          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.45.040:block:2",
          "start": 382
        },
        "quote": "(2) Upholding the administrative action and/or imposition of an administrative fee, charge or penalty, including the amount thereof. Upon issuance, such decision shall constitute a final determination.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.45.040:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
