        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "b507ab6c-7526-5cd9-bc00-91bef6fa654e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1511,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.45.040:block:4",
          "start": 955
        },
        "quote": "(c) If a person fails to respond to a notice of violation, other administrative action, or imposition of a fee or charge either by correcting the violation, if applicable, by payment of administrative penalty, by payment of the fee or charge or by making a written request within the specified time for an administrative hearing, a determination of liability, if any, shall be entered against the person. Such determination shall constitute a final determination. (Ord. 20206 § 13, 9-10-19; Ord. 19319 § 4, 10-13-09. Code 1995 § 2-489. Formerly 2.145.040.)",
